{"id":51755,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51755"},"modified":"2026-10-19T12:37:52","modified_gmt":"2026-10-19T11:37:52","slug":"alut-algarviana-ultra-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/alut-algarviana-ultra-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"ALUT \u2013 Algarviana Ultra Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">ALUT \u2013 Algarviana Ultra Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>ALUT \u2013 Algarviana Ultra Trail 2026<\/strong> (8\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se entre os dias <strong>26 e 29 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> (quinta-feira a domingo), atravessando longitudinalmente a serra algarvia ao longo da <strong>Via Algarviana<\/strong>. A partida \u00fanica na modalidade <strong>Solo<\/strong> \u00e9 dada na quinta-feira, <strong>26 de novembro, \u00e0s 14:30<\/strong>, no <strong>Cais de Alcoutim<\/strong> (concelho de <strong>Alcoutim<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Faro<\/strong>), e a meta situa-se em <strong>Sagres<\/strong> (Vila do Bispo), com tempo limite global de <strong>72 horas<\/strong> (encerramento no domingo, 29 de novembro, \u00e0s 14:30) e limite de 100 participantes.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A travessia de ultra endurance contabiliza <strong>305,6 km<\/strong> com <strong>8592m D+<\/strong> (8556m D-) em regime de semi-autonomia e orienta\u00e7\u00e3o obrigat\u00f3ria por GPS, estruturada em <strong>9 Bases de Vida (BV)<\/strong> com barreiras hor\u00e1rias de sa\u00edda: BV1 Furnazinhas (km 38,5 | 21:30 de 26\/11), BV2 Cachopo (km 75,9 | 04:30 de 27\/11), BV3 Barranco do Velho (km 104,9 | 11:30 de 27\/11), BV4 Benafim (km 129,9 | 17:00 de 27\/11), BV5 Messines (km 157,6 | 23:00 de 27\/11), BV6 Silves (km 184,5 | 07:00 de 28\/11), BV7 Monchique (km 219,6 | 18:00 de 28\/11), BV8 Marmelete (km 236,8 | 23:00 de 28\/11) e BV9 Bar\u00e3o de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o (km 272,7 | 08:00 de 29\/11) at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta em Sagres (km 305,6). Para validar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio comprovar a conclus\u00e3o (entre janeiro de 2024 e setembro de 2026) de uma prova de pelo menos 4 pontos ITRA (\u00edndice ITRA recomendado \u2265 400) e entregar certificado m\u00e9dico de aptid\u00e3o para ultra endurance at\u00e9 12 de novembro de 2026.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>ATR \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Algarve Trail Running<\/strong> com o apoio dos munic\u00edpios atravessados da Via Algarviana, o evento inclui transfer opcional Faro\u2013Alcoutim (26\/11) e Sagres\u2013Faro (29\/11), geolocalizador GPS, transporte de sacos para as bases de vida, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, assist\u00eancia de enfermagem e massagem em bases selecionadas, piso duro em Sagres, camisola oficial e pr\u00e9mio <em>finisher<\/em>. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 a 29 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Cais de Alcoutim (Partida) at\u00e9 Sagres (Meta), Via Algarviana, Faro<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Ultra Endurance Solo 305,6 km (8592m D+ \/ 8556m D-)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">ATR \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Algarve Trail Running<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">72h00 (Fecho da meta em Sagres a 29\/11 \u00e0s 14:30)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/storage\/events\/alut-algarviana-ultra-trail-2026\/69c549cf1eae5_Regulamento%20ALUT%202026_v1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Endurance<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">ALUT Solo 305,6 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 26 a 29 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 14:30 \u2022 8592m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 400.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (26\/03 a 30\/06)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 450.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/07 a 30\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 500.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/10 a 12\/11)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o ALUT \u2013 Algarviana Ultra Trail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 8\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do ALUT realiza-se de 26 a 29 de novembro de 2026 ao longo da Via Algarviana, no distrito de Faro. A partida \u00e9 dada no Cais de Alcoutim na quinta-feira, 26 de novembro, \u00e0s 14:30, e a meta localiza-se em Sagres, encerrando no domingo, 29 de novembro, \u00e0s 14:30 (tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 72 horas).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia, o desn\u00edvel e as Bases de Vida do percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Disputado exclusivamente na modalidade Solo, o percurso tem 305,6 km com 8592m D+ e 8556m D-, contando com 9 Bases de Vida (BV): BV1 Furnazinhas (km 38,5), BV2 Cachopo (km 75,9), BV3 Barranco do Velho (km 104,9), BV4 Benafim (km 129,9), BV5 Messines (km 157,6), BV6 Silves (km 184,5), BV7 Monchique (km 219,6), BV8 Marmelete (km 236,8) e BV9 Bar\u00e3o de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o (km 272,7), antes da chegada a Sagres (km 305,6).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no ALUT 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem de 26 de mar\u00e7o a 12 de novembro de 2026 (limitadas a 100 participantes) em tr\u00eas fases: 1\u00aa fase (26\/03 a 30\/06) por 400,00 \u20ac (com possibilidade de pagamento faseado mediante 1\u00aa presta\u00e7\u00e3o de 50 \u20ac); 2\u00aa fase (01\/07 a 30\/09) por 450,00 \u20ac; e 3\u00aa fase (01\/10 a 12\/11) por 500,00 \u20ac.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9-requisitos desportivos e m\u00e9dicos obrigat\u00f3rios?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio ter completado, entre janeiro de 2024 e setembro de 2026, pelo menos uma corrida certificada que atribua 4 pontos ITRA (recomenda-se \u00edndice ITRA m\u00ednimo de 400), bem como submeter at\u00e9 12 de novembro de 2026 um certificado m\u00e9dico v\u00e1lido que ateste aptid\u00e3o para desportos de ultra endurance e a declara\u00e7\u00e3o de exonera\u00e7\u00e3o de responsabilidade.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido durante os 305,6 km?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Cada atleta tem de transportar mochila\/bolsa com reservat\u00f3rio m\u00ednimo de 1500 ml de l\u00edquido (n\u00e3o h\u00e1 copos nas bases), aparelho\/rel\u00f3gio GPS com autonomia e capacidade m\u00ednima de 10.000 pontos (e baterias de reserva), reserva alimentar recomendada de 1000 kcal, dois sistemas de ilumina\u00e7\u00e3o frontal com pilhas\/baterias suplentes, manta t\u00e9rmica, imperme\u00e1vel, apito, telem\u00f3vel ligado e o geolocalizador GPS fornecido pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"ALUT \u2013 Algarviana Ultra Trail 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-26\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Cais de Alcoutim (Partida) at\u00e9 Sagres (Meta), Via Algarviana\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Alcoutim\", \"addressRegion\": \"Faro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"ATR \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Algarve Trail Running\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o ALUT \u2013 Algarviana Ultra Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 8\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do ALUT realiza-se de 26 a 29 de novembro de 2026 ao longo da Via Algarviana, no distrito de Faro. A partida \u00e9 dada no Cais de Alcoutim na quinta-feira, 26 de novembro, \u00e0s 14:30, e a meta localiza-se em Sagres, encerrando no domingo, 29 de novembro, \u00e0s 14:30 (tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 72 horas).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia, o desn\u00edvel e as Bases de Vida do percurso?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Disputado exclusivamente na modalidade Solo, o percurso tem 305,6 km com 8592m D+ e 8556m D-, contando com 9 Bases de Vida (BV): BV1 Furnazinhas (km 38,5), BV2 Cachopo (km 75,9), BV3 Barranco do Velho (km 104,9), BV4 Benafim (km 129,9), BV5 Messines (km 157,6), BV6 Silves (km 184,5), BV7 Monchique (km 219,6), BV8 Marmelete (km 236,8) e BV9 Bar\u00e3o de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o (km 272,7), antes da chegada a Sagres (km 305,6).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no ALUT 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem de 26 de mar\u00e7o a 12 de novembro de 2026 (limitadas a 100 participantes) em tr\u00eas fases: 1\u00aa fase (26\/03 a 30\/06) por 400,00 \u20ac (com possibilidade de pagamento faseado mediante 1\u00aa presta\u00e7\u00e3o de 50 \u20ac); 2\u00aa fase (01\/07 a 30\/09) por 450,00 \u20ac; e 3\u00aa fase (01\/10 a 12\/11) por 500,00 \u20ac.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9-requisitos desportivos e m\u00e9dicos obrigat\u00f3rios?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio ter completado, entre janeiro de 2024 e setembro de 2026, pelo menos uma corrida certificada que atribua 4 pontos ITRA (recomenda-se \u00edndice ITRA m\u00ednimo de 400), bem como submeter at\u00e9 12 de novembro de 2026 um certificado m\u00e9dico v\u00e1lido que ateste aptid\u00e3o para desportos de ultra endurance e a declara\u00e7\u00e3o de exonera\u00e7\u00e3o de responsabilidade.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido durante os 305,6 km?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Cada atleta tem de transportar mochila\/bolsa com reservat\u00f3rio m\u00ednimo de 1500 ml de l\u00edquido (n\u00e3o h\u00e1 copos nas bases), aparelho\/rel\u00f3gio GPS com autonomia e capacidade m\u00ednima de 10.000 pontos (e baterias de reserva), reserva alimentar recomendada de 1000 kcal, dois sistemas de ilumina\u00e7\u00e3o frontal com pilhas\/baterias suplentes, manta t\u00e9rmica, imperme\u00e1vel, apito, telem\u00f3vel ligado e o geolocalizador GPS fornecido pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70231,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,622],"event_type_2":[728,149,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-51755","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-alcoutim-faro","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-endurance","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-faro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-alut-algarviana-ultra-trail.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51755","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=51755"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51755\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70234,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51755\/revisions\/70234"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/70231"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=51755"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=51755"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"http